{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-06-25 11:30:00', 'title': "LILLY'S SURPASS-2 RESULTS PUBLISHED IN THE NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE SHOW TIRZEPATIDE ACHIEVED SUPERIOR A1C AND BODY WEIGHT REDUCTIONS COMPARED TO INJECTABLE SEMAGLUTIDE IN ADULTS WITH TYPE 2 DIABETES", 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, JUNE 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TIRZEPATIDE LED TO SUPERIOR A1C AND BODY WEIGHT REDUCTIONS FROM BASELINE COMPARED TO INJECTABLE SEMAGLUTIDE 1 MG IN 40-WEEK RESULTS FROM ELI LILLY AND COMPANY'S (NYSE: LLY) SURPASS-2 CLINICAL TRIAL, WHICH WERE SIMULTANEOUSLY PUBLISHED TODAY IN THE NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE (NEJM) 1 AND PRESENTED IN A LATE BREAKING POSTER PRESENTATION DURING THE AMERICAN DIABETES ASSOCIATION'S® (ADA) 81ST SCIENTIFIC SESSIONS®2. THESE RESULTS, WHICH WILL ALSO BE FEATURED DURING AN ADA-SPONSORED SYMPOSIUM ON TUESDAY, JUNE 29, SHOWED THAT ALL THREE TIRZEPATIDE DOSES ACHIEVED GREATER A1C AND WEIGHT REDUCTIONS COMPARED TO SEMAGLUTIDE."}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-06-25 11:30:00', 'title': "LILLY'S SURPASS-2 RESULTS PUBLISHED IN THE NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE SHOW TIRZEPATIDE ACHIEVED SUPERIOR A1C AND BODY WEIGHT REDUCTIONS COMPARED TO INJECTABLE SEMAGLUTIDE IN ADULTS WITH TYPE 2 DIABETES", 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, JUNE 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TIRZEPATIDE LED TO SUPERIOR A1C AND BODY WEIGHT REDUCTIONS FROM BASELINE COMPARED TO INJECTABLE SEMAGLUTIDE 1 MG IN 40-WEEK RESULTS FROM ELI LILLY AND COMPANY'S (NYSE: LLY) SURPASS-2 CLINICAL TRIAL, WHICH WERE SIMULTANEOUSLY PUBLISHED TODAY IN THE NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE (NEJM) 1 AND PRESENTED IN A LATE BREAKING POSTER PRESENTATION DURING THE AMERICAN DIABETES ASSOCIATION'S® (ADA) 81ST SCIENTIFIC SESSIONS®2. THESE RESULTS, WHICH WILL ALSO BE FEATURED DURING AN ADA-SPONSORED SYMPOSIUM ON TUESDAY, JUNE 29, SHOWED THAT ALL THREE TIRZEPATIDE DOSES ACHIEVED GREATER A1C AND WEIGHT REDUCTIONS COMPARED TO SEMAGLUTIDE."}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-06-25 11:30:00', 'title': "LILLY'S SURPASS-2 RESULTS PUBLISHED IN THE NE